  "description": "Show off your scooter skills with the Trace 180 Folding Scooter by Mongoose. The Trace 180 scooter features Full-coverage MaxGrip™ on the lightweight alloy deck and steel brake to ensure a secure, stable ride, while wide handlebars with bike-style grips offer superior handling. The 180 mm wheels come with ABEC – 7 bearings for long lasting use. Plus, the included kickstand provides convenient upright parking to protect the grips and frame from damage. And when it’s time to pack up for the day, the Trace folds for convenient storage and transport. This scooter can accommodate a wide variety of riders thanks to the quick-release adjustable height, complete with three lock-in pins, and a heavy-duty frame supports that up to 220 lbs.",
